values ('7d8a4645-364c-5d6f-90cc-1bebc2ffd0f7', 'Army', 'enlisted', 'DA PAM 600-25', 'Infantry (CMF 11) Career Progression Plan', null, 'CMF 11', null, 'https://api.army.mil/e2/c/downloads/2022/10/19/0c4aa606/cmf-11-final-18-oct-22.pdf',
   '2022-10-18', null, '2026-10-18T00:00:00Z', '26addbe2af373befb464e3531b8aa64d711d5f490cd5b5c912cf8f36ca3e2264', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: the 2022-10-18 date comes from the official file name and the Army G-1 listing (https://www.army.mil/g-1), checked 2026-10-16; the PDF body may print no date. Imported for 11B, 11C, 11Z. Duties and prerequisites are NOT imported from this guide (DA PAM 611-21 is the source for them); promotion-board criteria are stored but never shown. LIMITATIONS: Reserve Component chapters and professional-development-model figures are not imported; career-field-wide rank guidance is attached to every MOS of this guide that has its own chapter.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-600-25-cmf-11-final-18-oct-22@2026-10-18', '8889ace7d77ba3c63773d0e811efa85ff21cfc9dddb8dbd699935c994e5dcfeb')
on conflict (id) do update set
