(4) Staff Sergeants should request access to the U.S. Army Engineer Training Library on Teams to gain information on Engineer specific tasks and equipment that can aid in training their Soldiers while developing themselves.', '457d3ce4d6da905c4b2a186189bdb8bd84d683e2b668c90384db91ae96654905', 3, 3, null, 73, null, null, false, null),
