  ('f6b857ff-adeb-5813-bcce-b8a8e7abcd20', 'b0498927-bd35-5106-96c9-4cabc0932ac1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '12Z', null, 'development', 'E-9', null, 'Sergeant Major/Command Sergeant Major — recommended career management (applies to every MOS in this career management field)', 'Chapter 3. Recommended Career Management Self-development by Rank.', '(1) The goal of SGMs and CSMs is to possess a bachelor’s degree and work towards a graduate degree in their chosen discipline. Professional reading, credentialing, professional certifications, apprenticeship programs, and college courses help the SNCOs develop organizational leadership skills needed to coach, teach, and mentor Soldiers. Outstanding communications skills are required just by the nature of the number of Soldiers their communications reach. Skills in community and public relations are also important, since the SGM or CSM will often represent the command or the Army in civic functions.
