   '2026-08-25', null, '2026-10-18T00:00:00Z', 'fa123213688ff9164dbe7f92ca62f0b9c44528623106d7784930b6ab7f121fda', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: the 2026-08-25 date comes from the official file name and the Army G-1 listing (https://www.army.mil/g-1), checked 2026-10-16; the PDF body may print no date. Imported for 13B, 13F, 13J, 13M, 13R, 13Z. Duties and prerequisites are NOT imported from this guide (DA PAM 611-21 is the source for them); promotion-board criteria are stored but never shown. LIMITATIONS: Reserve Component chapters and professional-development-model figures are not imported; career-field-wide rank guidance is attached to every MOS of this guide that has its own chapter.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-600-25-cmf-13-da-pam-600-25-25-aug-26@2026-10-18', '210e7b17b55b690ea5c53accdf43856c15956df9e56c848878a9398185934371')
