(b) Nominative (PDSI L3C): - SFOD-A/E/G or SMU TM SGT - Special Forces Proponent Personnel Career Manager - HRC Career Management NCO - Any SFC filling a nominative or mission critical MSG billet
(c) Mission Critical (PDSI L3D): - Team NCOIC at Robin Sage, MOS, SUT, and SFAS - NCOA Senior Instructor/Writer - Any SFC filling a TOE/TDA 18Z5 position.
(d) Mission Essential: All other SFC positions not previously listed.', '85da7cbee4324e05047b3fa7b1fc9f22c0d6f5131593027bebca44d29299fc35', 23, 23, null, 123, null, null, false, null),
  ('6ae0c54e-cc55-52b6-b85a-95f2e29b8c2e', 'ef906047-2061-5aac-9b72-c7c5df2e2a60', 'Army', 'enlisted', '18Z', null, 'assignments', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant / First Sergeant — assignments (appendix; applies to every MOS in this chapter)', 'Chapter 4-app1. Appendix A – Assignments', '(a) Key Developmental (ASI 8H): - 24 months as a Team Sergeant on a SFOD-A/E/G, or SMU (12 months must be served as a MSG)
(b) Nominative (PDSI L3A): - Special Forces Proponent Personnel Senior Career Manager - HRC Senior Talent Management NCO - A/4/1 SWTG(A) 1SG - HHC 1SG at Special Forces Group - HHC 1SG at USASOC, USAJFKSWCS, or 1st SFC(A) - 18A 1SG or Chief Instructor/Writer - NCOA 1SG - Any MSG filling a nominative or critical SGM billet.
(c) Mission Critical (PDSI L3B): - All other 1SG positions - J3 Operations SGT at TSOC - S3 Operations SGT at Special Forces Group (Group level) - SFPC, SFAS, or Any Phase of SFQC Chief Instructor/Writer - Any NCOA Chief instructor/Writer - Any ASI or SQI producing Chief Instructor/Writer
(d) Mission Essential: - All other MSG positions not previously listed.', 'ec43265c7f09a454b2475fa221a0d8d99b314be172701c6ac36effc646527937', 23, 23, null, 124, null, null, false, null),
  ('a713b306-1cb8-59d2-aeca-dfa09e2de0fb', 'ef906047-2061-5aac-9b72-c7c5df2e2a60', 'Army', 'enlisted', '18Z', null, 'assignments', 'E-9', null, 'Sergeant Major — assignments (appendix; applies to every MOS in this chapter)', 'Chapter 4-app1. Appendix A – Assignments', '(a) Key Developmental: - 12 months as Special Forces Company SGM or SMU SGM. (Note 1: position can be filled by a MSG who is a graduate of the USASMA, JSOFSEA, or equivalent course.) (Note 2: Key Development time can be completed as a MSG as long as they are a graduate of the USASMA, JSOFSEA, or equivalent course)
(b) Nominative: - SFAS SGM - SF Proponent SGM - HRC TADD ARSOF Division SGM - G3 SGM at USASOC, USAJFKSWCS, or 1 st SFC(A) G3 SGM - J3 SGM at TSOC - S3 SGM at Special Forces Group or Special Warfare Training Group
(c) Mission Critical: - S3 SGM at Special Forces Group (Battalion level) - Company SGM at any phase of SFQC - SGM at G8, IG, or SMU
(d) Mission Essential: - All other SGM positions not previously listed.', 'e3e9d086002c7f49c7ee866cca5357d1fe1b562128f590e333d07c0a2d77fb6d', 24, 24, null, 125, null, null, false, null);
