   '2026-03-13', null, '2026-10-18T00:00:00Z', '00d9e7519050d1a54d1369cb077a960486297fb9e4c2d84843b6e4449249c610', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: the 2026-03-13 date comes from the official file name and the Army G-1 listing (https://www.army.mil/g-1), checked 2026-10-16; the PDF body may print no date. Imported for 27D. Duties and prerequisites are NOT imported from this guide (DA PAM 611-21 is the source for them); promotion-board criteria are stored but never shown. LIMITATIONS: Reserve Component chapters and professional-development-model figures are not imported; career-field-wide rank guidance is attached to every MOS of this guide that has its own chapter.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-600-25-cmf-27-da-pam-600-25-13-mar-26@2026-10-18', 'b5968cec327a0b9142e698d40c66e937eba41308e725ec5107bfc59d37ecf2a6')
