   '2025-06-27', null, '2026-10-18T00:00:00Z', '4ff7b67961cc19be5504ba194a684e809035eb9a270b4c900198af17211dee0c', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: the 2025-06-27 date comes from the official file name and the Army G-1 listing (https://www.army.mil/g-1), checked 2026-10-16; the PDF body may print no date. Imported for 35F, 35G, 35L, 35M, 35N, 35P, 35S, 35T, 35Z. Duties and prerequisites are NOT imported from this guide (DA PAM 611-21 is the source for them); promotion-board criteria are stored but never shown. LIMITATIONS: Reserve Component chapters and professional-development-model figures are not imported; career-field-wide rank guidance is attached to every MOS of this guide that has its own chapter.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-600-25-cmf-35-da-pam-600-25-27-jun-25@2026-10-18', 'e8e42466021062f9767180a694f3a595efa32fd5648a5fa1798618b4b618ebc2')
