(3) SFCs mentor junior enlisted Soldiers and NCOs to compete in Soldier boards as outlined in paragraphs 1-3a, 1-3b, and 1-3c and coach them in earning the ESB. Excellence in leadership should be demonstrated through participation in SGT Audie Murphy or SGT Morales Award boards.
