  ('3e936d5c-4f3e-5137-9e88-44e85637619f', '648e1a41-1d8a-53b5-8353-c635aca4b0f2', 'Army', 'enlisted', '46Z', null, 'development', 'E-5', null, 'Sergeant (SGT/E-5) — recommended career management (applies to every MOS in this career management field)', 'Chapter 1. Public Affairs (Career Management Field 46) Career Progression Plan', '(1) SGTs continue to improve their Soldier and MOS skills while mentoring others, strive to participate in MDMP, and seek to achieve a solid understanding of HQDA communication priorities, themes, and messages. SGTs also pursue mastery of direct leadership of their subordinates.
