   '2022-04-12', null, '2026-10-18T00:00:00Z', '7db78b0e4889ce5f009d261c1e5f6d11eed65650af7bf8017dadf8d35f32fe2a', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: the 12 Apr 2022 date comes from the official file name ("Update 12 Apr 22"); the PDF body prints no date. This is an older update than most other guides; the Army G-1 listing carries no newer CMF 51 guide as of 2026-10-16. Imported for 51C. Duties and prerequisites are NOT imported from this guide (DA PAM 611-21 is the source for them); promotion-board criteria are stored but never shown. The guide is not written in numbered chapters; its sections (21-3 CMF-wide self-development by rank, 21-4 MOS 51C goals for development) were cut by the manifest. The Army career degree and GI Jobs pointers are not imported. LIMITATIONS: Reserve Component chapters and professional-development-model figures are not imported; career-field-wide rank guidance is attached to every MOS of this guide that has its own chapter.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-600-25-cmf-51-update-12-apr-22@2026-10-18', '70f7017c7085d8e64187897eaaee8ca5827989e15b105336ed21cdbd2a9d883c')
