   '2025-09-03', null, '2026-10-18T00:00:00Z', 'ae0264c9957ad84c7ab749b47e3452fbc2689b4a9be59620598c94583597e765', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: the 2025-09-03 date comes from the official file name and the Army G-1 listing (https://www.army.mil/g-1), checked 2026-10-16; the PDF body may print no date. Imported for 74D. Duties and prerequisites are NOT imported from this guide (DA PAM 611-21 is the source for them); promotion-board criteria are stored but never shown. LIMITATIONS: Reserve Component chapters and professional-development-model figures are not imported; career-field-wide rank guidance is attached to every MOS of this guide that has its own chapter.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-600-25-cmf-74-da-pam-600-25-3-sep-25@2026-10-18', 'b8d759cdc4721ffbaad6562240900a8610359242a0542f3654787e7cf323f17e')
