   '2024-12-18', null, '2026-10-18T00:00:00Z', '3aa7d24fdc0b18b21f340a0402ed5c624faa0841d39e535115447dbf3b456977', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: the 2024-12-18 date comes from the official file name and the Army G-1 listing (https://www.army.mil/g-1), checked 2026-10-16; the PDF body may print no date. Imported for 88H, 88K, 88L, 88M, 88N, 88U, 88Z. Duties and prerequisites are NOT imported from this guide (DA PAM 611-21 is the source for them); promotion-board criteria are stored but never shown. LIMITATIONS: Reserve Component chapters and professional-development-model figures are not imported; career-field-wide rank guidance is attached to every MOS of this guide that has its own chapter.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-600-25-cmf-88-da-pam-600-25-18-dec-24@2026-10-18', 'bce8787c90b061659e9e372c2c4555d20e4358c897d36b0e569079b4e6ded3a9')
