(2) These NCOs should study and master the following military publications: FM 3-0; FM 4-0; FM 7-22; AR 350-1; AR 670-1; ADP 4-0; ADP 5-0; ADP 6-0; ADP 6-22; ADP 7-0; ADRP 1-03; TC 3-21.5; TC 3-21.75; STP 21-24-; all -10 level maintenance manuals associated with their equipment; and battle drills associated with their current assignment.
