  ('eb739113-e457-5be0-95a2-e7bb50c019a1', '3b3029e8-8048-5c9b-a9bd-b75915f5547e', 'Army', 'enlisted', '91P', null, 'development', 'E-6', null, 'Staff Sergeant — recommended career management (applies to every MOS in this career management field)', 'Chapter 3. Recommend career management self-development by rank', '(1)The quality and success of a Staff Sergeant’s career is in direct proportion to a consistent commitment to excellence, regardless of the mission. Staff Sergeants who are committed to achieving high goals will develop leadership skills and have the practical knowledge and ambition to put them to good use.
