ng Developer, TNG MGT NCO, , TNG NCO (DSTE), TNG/DEV (SLC), Unit Supply NCO, Victim ADV (SHARP), Warehouse NCOIC, and Warehouse SUPV.', '6bf0cfaec65d4f0042845c66997a3b2a281270b4b5d29e4dcc984c01a9f63c99', 11, 12, null, 80, null, null, false, null),
