(8) NCOs should strive to become multifunctional by pursuing additional training and skill development. One way to achieve this is by aiming for the Personnel Development Skill Identifier (PDSI) M1F, which focuses on becoming a Multifunctional Logistician NCO. In addition, NCOs can actively engage in self-improvement by participating in various competitions such as the Expert Soldier Competitions, Army Best Warrior Competition, NCO of the Quarter/Year boards and Instructor of the Quarter/Year boards. These competitions not only expand the NCOs knowledge but also instill discipline and enhance their verbal communication skills. Furthermore, NCOs can join prestigious organizations like Sergeant Audie Murphy and/or Sergeant Morales Clubs, which further broaden their expertise and professional network.
