values ('94f1d82f-9b7b-5be8-80fb-1f964e2e2fa2', 'Army', 'officer', 'DA PAM 600-3', 'Aviation Branch officer career pamphlet, DA PAM 600-3 chapter (30 June 2021)', null, 'Aviation (branch code 15)', 'U.S. Army Aviation Center of Excellence (Aviation branch proponent)', 'https://api.army.mil/e2/c/downloads/2022/08/03/8d0a3936/1-av-branch-da-pam-600-3-as-of-20210630.pdf',
   '2021-06-30', null, '2026-10-18T00:00:00Z', '332fee1deecb17f93ff317762c098d2ac0b5a2db960d40419996da231380005d', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: printed in the running title (''Aviation Branch – 30 June 2021''). An older chapter; the Army G-1 page lists it as current (uploaded 3 Aug 2022). Imported for 15A: the grade-by-grade development sections (O-1..O-2, O-3, O-4, O-5, O-6) as the pamphlet gives them for the branch or functional area; they apply to every AOC listed. Duties and prerequisites are not imported from this pamphlet (DA PAM 611-21 is the source); figures and tables are not extracted. Stored for AOC 15A (Aviation, General), the branch''s general AOC; the AOC-specific sections for 15B, 15C and 15D are not imported. LIMITATIONS: Stored for AOC 15A (Aviation, General), the branch''s general AOC; the AOC-specific sections for 15B, 15C and 15D are not imported.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-600-3-1-av-branch-da-pam-600-3-as-of-20210630@2026-10-18', '159ca3453633b00969301e4ac24bdcba9ce25486aad3aa2ae0731fb295217ad6')
