   '2026-02-01', null, '2026-10-18T00:00:00Z', 'f1d8da42c6553f259aa8402eaed1904d64bf38748416a69d0619ef9283909265', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: the running title of the Signal Corps text reads ''Signal Corps – 01 February 2026''; the file name says FY25 and the Army G-1 page lists the upload in July 2026. Imported for 25A: the grade-by-grade development sections (O-1..O-2, O-3, O-4, O-5, O-6) as the pamphlet gives them for the branch or functional area; they apply to every AOC listed. Duties and prerequisites are not imported from this pamphlet (DA PAM 611-21 is the source); figures and tables are not extracted. LIMITATIONS: figures (development models) are images and are not imported.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-600-3-da-pam-600-3-fy25-signal-final@2026-10-18', 'c567df072fa1e2571a2277eba9e1c91764acb594bb066894276039ace64a6ba0')
