   '2026-06-09', null, '2026-10-18T00:00:00Z', 'b76224f5887cf246b4a10cbd6e04966d8f3a5efb63ff00a1d8d8865a12283c03', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: the date 9 June 2026 is printed in the first line of the PDF. Imported for 12A: the grade-by-grade development sections (O-1..O-2, O-3, O-4, O-5, O-6) as the pamphlet gives them for the branch or functional area; they apply to every AOC listed. Duties and prerequisites are not imported from this pamphlet (DA PAM 611-21 is the source); figures and tables are not extracted. The pamphlet gives no Colonel section in the imported run. The second run of grade headings (page 30 on) is the Reserve Component text and is not imported. LIMITATIONS: The pamphlet gives no Colonel section in the imported run. The second run of grade headings (page 30 on) is the Reserve Component text and is not imported.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-600-3-en-br-9-june-2026@2026-10-18', 'd05fce6cff665eedcad98dd60fede7913727824a7f73d2e24f3003524466d3cc')
