values ('49c69765-6117-5969-8ab3-843d12a58c64', 'Army', 'officer', 'DA PAM 600-3', 'Strategist Functional Area career pamphlet, DA PAM 600-3 chapter (1 April 2020)', null, 'Functional Area 59', 'Army Strategist proponent', 'https://api.army.mil/e2/c/downloads/2023/02/28/1fd5abfc/fa-59-strategist-da-pam-600-3-as-of-1-apr-20.pdf',
   '2020-04-01', null, '2026-10-18T00:00:00Z', 'e22d45e263d267a28768cc621b3b8d2773fcb0e7acfb90150a39d0dec5b2c8d6', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: printed in the running title (''Strategist Functional Area – 1 April 2020''). This is an older chapter; the Army G-1 page still lists it as the current one (uploaded 28 Feb 2023). Imported for 59A: the grade-by-grade development sections (O-4, O-5, O-6) as the pamphlet gives them for the branch or functional area; they apply to every AOC listed. Duties and prerequisites are not imported from this pamphlet (DA PAM 611-21 is the source); figures and tables are not extracted. LIMITATIONS: figures (development models) are images and are not imported.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-600-3-fa-59-strategist-da-pam-600-3-as-of-1-apr-20@2026-10-18', 'f5220d9e620e6c416e5107e699d34fa70767ec4b10343669d178deb1419c09a5')
