   '2026-08-06', null, '2026-10-18T00:00:00Z', '9df706176b3b85d53bb87b4880832032f57354e6d0ca96e7fb519e95c06e4e86', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: the PDF prints only ''AUG2026''; 2026-08-06 is the upload date in the official URL path (…/2026/08/06/…). Imported for 35A, 35B: the grade-by-grade development sections (O-1..O-2, O-3, O-4, O-5, O-6) as the pamphlet gives them for the branch or functional area; they apply to every AOC listed. Duties and prerequisites are not imported from this pamphlet (DA PAM 611-21 is the source); figures and tables are not extracted. The second run of grade headings (page 22 on) is the Reserve Component text and is not imported. LIMITATIONS: The second run of grade headings (page 22 on) is the Reserve Component text and is not imported.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-600-3-mi-da-pam-600-3-aug2026@2026-10-18', '66faa82e740075efa61ce1d2dbaa51fa67831c91e335295923c3fff6fba17cc0')
