   '2024-06-21', null, '2026-10-18T00:00:00Z', '4891faa3648dc7a75b057e657ed1bfa28aebb530995b00e5a1117b2c3da4bcb3', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: the date 21 June 2024 is printed on the first page of the PDF. Imported for 31A: the grade-by-grade development sections (O-1..O-2, O-3, O-4, O-5, O-6) as the pamphlet gives them for the branch or functional area; they apply to every AOC listed. Duties and prerequisites are not imported from this pamphlet (DA PAM 611-21 is the source); figures and tables are not extracted. The second run of grade headings (page 17 on) is the Reserve Component text and is not imported. LIMITATIONS: The second run of grade headings (page 17 on) is the Reserve Component text and is not imported.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-600-3-military-police-da-pam-600-3-june-2024@2026-10-18', '8c59b493b212bba8dcb43469fa626952a7ab67655d64020b0742e2de4425ecef')
