values ('7a6a4906-e811-5fb6-97fc-206842efb40c', 'Army', 'officer', 'DA PAM 611-21', 'Military Occupational Classification and Structure — officer branches, functional areas and AOCs (chapter 3)', 'Chapter 3', 'All Army officer AOCs', 'Military Personnel Structure & Plans Division (DAPE-PRP), HQDA ODCS G-1', 'https://api.army.mil/e2/c/downloads/2025/12/04/e1190672/chapter-3-officer-branches-and-fas.pdf',
   '2025-11-01', null, '2026-10-16T00:00:00Z', '13a98f575b75d3aadfcab725e0bb9f98d6863ce89e9beb00c9bb52632b40ff7d', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: the DA PAM 611-21 (Smartbook) cover reads "End of Fiscal Year 2025 … November 2025"; no day is stated, so the 1st is used. The chapter was posted on api.army.mil on 2025-12-04. Individual specifications carry their own effective dates (e.g. "Effective 202610"); those are stored per passage, not per source. The officer chapter describes each AOC in general; it is not written by grade. Grade ranges come from the structure chart in the same chapter. LIMITATIONS: AOCs whose section has no "Description of duties" item (listed in the report) have no description here; qualification, special-qualification and physical-demand items are skipped as requirements.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-611-21-officer-ch3@2026-10-16', '0a2d452c40fa610ea2d05137998fa26f13e62525e65a094d77039db182fd064b')
