(n) MI Senior Field Grade Warrant Officers must have competed the WO Senior Service Education Course prior to nomination for specified CW5 billets.', '2b650a1ea88867e89ef07421d224e1a7227a8f503de9f4b7228a562be867e535', 88, 89, null, 165, '2024-10-01', null, true, null),
  ('9e4e7c69-340e-5d2c-a504-ebc7ab3856a1', '3021ff69-4dd8-5576-afdb-49874e1d8e20', 'Army', 'warrant', '351Z', 'ATTACHE INTELLIGENCE OPERATIONS TECHNICIAN', 'rank_duties', 'W-1..W-2', null, 'Duties — WO1/CW2', 'DA PAM 611-21, ch. 8 (warrant officer specifications)', '(a) Leads joint operations and administrative support teams in Defense Attaché Offices (DAO) at diplomatic missions worldwide.
(b) Serves as principle advisor to the Senior Defense Official/Defense Attaché (SDO/DATT) and ensures operations are conducted in accordance with requisite policies.
(c) Represents the Department of Defense (DOD as diplomat and conducts liaison with host nation and third country officials per diplomatic protocols.
(d) Conducts inter-agency coordination with embassy partners to further DOD efforts and advance US foreign-policy.
(e) Synchronizes the DAO operations, performs management in support of strategic reporting and ensures compliance with relevant regulations and policies.
(f) Facilitates DOD activities in foreign countries by providing operational, administrative, and logistical support to personnel caring out of DOD initiatives.
(g) Serves as a key contributor to the embassy country team and advocates for DOD equities.
(h) Advises DOD personnel on embassy operations and inter-agency processes.
(i) Plans and manages DAO Administration, policy compliance, finance personnel, reporting, security and logistics.', '0d53c47abb8ebae8485f8145a6c7c45071727dceb7a3178b71141be557a70708', 91, 91, null, 166, null, null, false, null),
  ('bc1f50ea-d2a0-569b-a3ab-cbf8ccd5160e', '3021ff69-4dd8-5576-afdb-49874e1d8e20', 'Army', 'warrant', '351Z', 'ATTACHE INTELLIGENCE OPERATIONS TECHNICIAN', 'rank_duties', 'W-3', null, 'Duties — CW3', 'DA PAM 611-21, ch. 8 (warrant officer specifications)', '(a) Performs duties described in paragraph g(1).
(b) Conducts inspections of both Defense Intelligence Agency internal elements and Defense Intelligence Agency military personnel, and investigations as directed by the Defense Intelligence Agency Inspector General.', '14264511246161b8f5017cab13ee6251f62ee02bf6cc01f98c9f4f70f16e99c6', 91, 91, null, 167, null, null, true, null),
  ('b88f337f-7f45-5b8e-844d-5908d0216ebc', '3021ff69-4dd8-5576-afdb-49874e1d8e20', 'Army', 'warrant', '351Z', 'ATTACHE INTELLIGENCE OPERATIONS TECHNICIAN', 'rank_duties', 'W-4', null, 'Duties — CW4', 'DA PAM 611-21, ch. 8 (warrant officer specifications)', '(a) Performs duties described in paragraph g(2).
(b) Implements DCSINT, DA, INSCOM, and Commander, FSC policies regarding the administration of Army attaché personnel.
(c) Coordinates policy with Defense Intelligence Agency and HRC; supervises the activities of warrant officers, enlisted personnel, and DA civilians responsible for providing administrative, personnel management, military pay, and Army representational support for Army personnel serving in 90 countries who are affiliated with the Defense Attaché Systems; and provides administrative management of the Army attaché and support staff personnel procurement programs.', '67924d1b2690570a1766069234ff3ab4b748b0469052ecc9c50c6e151139fa9e', 91, 92, null, 168, null, null, true, null),
  ('7dac30d7-0b6e-593f-9452-68954c53f87f', '3021ff69-4dd8-5576-afdb-49874e1d8e20', 'Army', 'warrant', '351Z', 'ATTACHE INTELLIGENCE OPERATIONS TECHNICIAN', 'rank_duties', 'W-5', null, 'Duties — CW5', 'DA PAM 611-21, ch. 8 (warrant officer specifications)', '(a) Performs duties described in paragraph g(3).
