  ('43fc926c-cb8e-55d3-85c9-1d9599980177', '3021ff69-4dd8-5576-afdb-49874e1d8e20', 'Army', 'warrant', '352N', 'SIGNALS INTELLIGENCE ANALYSIS TECHNICIAN', 'rank_duties', 'W-1..W-2', null, 'Duties — WO1/CW2', 'DA PAM 611-21, ch. 8 (warrant officer specifications)', '(a) Manages personnel and equipment to collect, process, exploit, locate, identify, analyze and report on SIGINT information to support tactical, operational, and strategic requirements across all domains.
(b) Establishes priorities and provides guidance and oversight for collection, exploitation, analysis and reporting missions.
(c) Manages training for subordinates and peers on technical, operational, and tactical SIGINT skills required to perform the mission.
(d) Coordinates staff actions to fulfill all requirements in support of SIGINT mission activities and the Commander’s intent.
(e) Advises the commander and staff with regard to tactical and technical SIGINT operations, activities, and personnel.
(f) May serve as Discipline Analyst or Functional Manager at any echelon.', 'f0b8013519c5b3b5289e3c3b17380c8975dd170042d0e983517ba92a213a5fc7', 93, 94, null, 170, null, null, false, null),
  ('4e210336-58b2-50a9-9b68-be68ca255235', '3021ff69-4dd8-5576-afdb-49874e1d8e20', 'Army', 'warrant', '352N', 'SIGNALS INTELLIGENCE ANALYSIS TECHNICIAN', 'rank_duties', 'W-3', null, 'Duties — CW3', 'DA PAM 611-21, ch. 8 (warrant officer specifications)', '(a) Directs and performs duties shown in paragraph g(1)
